                                                "sense_id": "65ce5708-02da-3af9-9125-d6e8366e27f9",
                                                "text": "According to Indian report, a great breeding-ground for the blue wavy is the country lying in the interior of the north-east point of Labrador, Cape Dudley Digges."
                                            },
